$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}=-k(T-{T}_{S}),\n$$\n\nwhere ${T}_{S}$ is the temperature of the surroundings, and $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality.\n\nIn our case, ${T}_{S}={12}^{∘}\\text{C},$ and we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}=-k(T-12).\n$$"] [:db/add "ab244644-ccd4-514e-b191-8c7819bc7748" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "ab244644-ccd4-514e-b191-8c7819bc7748" :question/answer-fields "85c5075c-961b-59f9-89f9-548c563cb48d"] [:db/ensure "ab244644-ccd4-514e-b191-8c7819bc7748" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186078583 :knowledge-point/questions "ab244644-ccd4-514e-b191-8c7819bc7748"] [:db/add "cef92983-1935-54c2-bc91-99f0b03c7949" :answer/id #uuid "cef92983-1935-54c2-bc91-99f0b03c7949"] [:db/add "cef92983-1935-54c2-bc91-99f0b03c7949" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cef92983-1935-54c2-bc91-99f0b03c7949" :answer/value "{T}^{′}(t)=-k(T-70)"] [:db/ensure "cef92983-1935-54c2-bc91-99f0b03c7949" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ba0ad2af-a525-5d42-ab36-45c260029c2f" :answer/id #uuid "ba0ad2af-a525-5d42-ab36-45c260029c2f"] [:db/add "ba0ad2af-a525-5d42-ab36-45c260029c2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ba0ad2af-a525-5d42-ab36-45c260029c2f" :answer/value "{T}^{′}(t)=-kT(T-70)"] [:db/ensure "ba0ad2af-a525-5d42-ab36-45c260029c2f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "790823da-d3ca-5323-814f-de9286dc80bf" :answer/id #uuid "790823da-d3ca-5323-814f-de9286dc80bf"] [:db/add "790823da-d3ca-5323-814f-de9286dc80bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "790823da-d3ca-5323-814f-de9286dc80bf" :answer/value "{T}^{′}(t)=kT(T-70)"] [:db/ensure "790823da-d3ca-5323-814f-de9286dc80bf" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b7e9d369-2677-5dfa-9910-3e1a09c8374c" :answer/id #uuid "b7e9d369-2677-5dfa-9910-3e1a09c8374c"] [:db/add "b7e9d369-2677-5dfa-9910-3e1a09c8374c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b7e9d369-2677-5dfa-9910-3e1a09c8374c" :answer/value "{T}^{′}(t)=-k(T+70)"] [:db/ensure "b7e9d369-2677-5dfa-9910-3e1a09c8374c" :answer/validate] [:db/